<h3>Date ranges and disabled dates</h3>

<p>Allowed date ranges for a date picker can be set by specifying earliest and latest allowed dates. Individual dates can also be disabled.</p>

<p>In this example, a max date of 28 January 2024, a min date of 02 January 2024 has been set and three days in January 2024 have been disabled.</p>

{{#>_docs-example separated=true}}
{{>_date-picker single=true disabled=true id=disabledId}}
{{/_docs-example}}

